Thumbs.db

# The Godot client export and the model tree it fetches.
#
# NEITHER IS PART OF THIS SITE'S BUILD. They live in the `playblackout-assets`
# R2 bucket and are served by `worker/index.ts` at `/client/*` and
# `/static/webclient/models/*` -- because `index.wasm` is 37.7 MiB against
# Cloudflare's hard 25 MiB per-file cap on static assets, which no plan lifts.
#
# So putting an export under `public/` does nothing for a deploy: Astro would
# copy it into `dist/` and wrangler would reject the upload. Publish both with
# `muddev/deploy/webexport/publish.ps1` instead. These rules exist only so a
# stray local export cannot be committed by accident.
public/client/
public/static/
